### Adaptive branch site random effects likelihood test 
Likelihood ratio test for episodic diversifying positive selection at Holm-Bonferroni corrected _p =   0.0500_ found **8** branches under selection among **47** tested.

* CYCLOBATES, p-value =  0.00000
* SCALARIS, p-value =  0.00000
* IRIS, p-value =  0.00000
* CRACHERODII, p-value =  0.00001
* NODE5, p-value =  0.00040
* NODE22, p-value =  0.02207
* WALALLENSIS, p-value =  0.04168
* MIDAE, p-value =  0.04196

